[61.98279, "o", "applied   AR-2201  1763284210.M2201P4120.fernq.eml  grant priya.raman: +deploy-operator\r\nheld      AR-2202  1763300655.M2202P4120.fernq.eml  grant wen.zhao: sender wen.zhao@fernhollow.dev is not delegated\r\napplied   AR-2203  1763374501.M2203P4120.fernq.eml  revoke tomas.eriksen: -billing-reader\r\napplied   AR-2204  1763460930.M2204P4120.fernq.eml  grant deniz.kaya: +release-manager +deploy-operator +ci-viewer +artifact-publisher\r\nheld      AR-2205  1763546561.M2205P4120.fernq.eml  grant svc-release-bot: sender jonas.peltier@fernhollow.dev is not delegated\r\napplied   AR-2206  1763566233.M2206P4120.fernq.eml  revoke svc-legacy-ci: -deploy-operator -ci-viewer\r\nheld      AR-2207  1763650820.M2207P4120.fernq.eml  grant lea.fontaine: sender priya.raman@fernhollow.dev is not delegated\r\napplied   AR-2208  1763654011.M2208P4120.fernq.eml  grant alice.ng: +artifact-publisher\r\n(dry run: nothing written)\r\nVerified: preview changed no queue, policy, ACL, or audit files.\r\n"]
